    "content": "<p>Buckle up for fantastic limited-time events to kick off July, Pilots!&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>From now until <strong>July 8,</strong> you may find yourself battling on the new event map <strong>Solidus Node: Depot</strong>. A mysterious client has contracted Pilots to run combat simulations on Solidus Node: Depot to generate valuable tactical data about a high-value site. Act fast before the simulation ends!</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/07/234-Week1%20Events/1.png\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Arm <strong>Grim </strong>with <strong>Jigsaw</strong>, a new<strong> Titan Weapon</strong> available via Daily Deals<strong>! </strong>This rip-roaring armament can fire saw blades at enemies to cut them down to size. Keep an eye on the in-game Store for a <strong>boosted chance</strong> to obtain this devastating tool of destruction from now until <strong>July 8</strong>. (Jigsaw will remain in the rotation for Daily Deals after this event ends).</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><preview-image src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/07/234-Week1%20Events/2.png\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/07/234-Week1%20Events/2.png\" width=\"525\" /></preview-image></p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Download War Robots: Frontiers for free today:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;5</strong></a><strong>│</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;4</strong></a><strong>│ </strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox Series X|S</strong></a><strong> │</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox One</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/steam\"><strong>Steam</strong></a><strong> │ </strong><a href=\"https://my.games/play/war_robots_frontiers_mg\"><strong>MY.GAMES Launcher</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stay tuned to our official <a href=\"https://x.com/WRFrontiers\">X</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wrfrontiers\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wrfrontiers/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@wrfrontiers\">TikTok</a> channels, and join the <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/warrobotsfrontiers/\">War Robots: Frontiers subreddit</a> and <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/discord\">Discord</a> for all the latest news and updates.</p>",
